# You write the header, the trust you give each input, and the Checks.
# The AI writes the body. It is a claim until your Checks witness it.
To fact given n, answering an Int:
  n is an Int, trusted 256 of 256.
  It shrinks by n.
  Make sure n is not void.
  If n is at most 0:
    Answer 1.
  Otherwise:
    Answer n times fact of (n minus 1).
Check: fact of 0 gives 1, trusted 120.
Check: fact of 5 gives 120, trusted 120.
